('s2-chat_bubble-set-gece-limani', 'Buoy Light', 'Harbour night, the lighthouse beam passing, a buoy light breathing.', 'chat_bubble', 'data:,', NULL, 440, NULL, NULL, 's2-set-gece-limani', 'epic', 23000, 'gece-limani', '{"name":{"tr":"Şamandıra","en":"Buoy Light","de":"Bojenlicht","es":"Luz de boya","fr":"Feu de bouée","pt-BR":"Luz de boia","ru":"Огонь буя"},"description":{"tr":"Liman gecesi, geçen fener ışığı ve nefes alan bir şamandıra.","en":"Harbour night, the lighthouse beam passing, a buoy light breathing.","de":"Hafennacht, der Leuchtturmstrahl zieht vorbei, ein Bojenlicht atmet.","es":"Noche de puerto, el haz del faro pasa y una boya respira.","fr":"Nuit au port, le faisceau du phare passe, une bouée respire.","pt-BR":"Noite no porto, o farol passa e uma boia respira.","ru":"Ночь в гавани, луч маяка и дышащий огонь буя."}}'::jsonb, '["shop2","c2","animated","set","set:gece-limani"]'::jsonb, NULL),
