('s2-chat_bubble-set-orkide-sisi', 'Leaf Drop', 'Glasshouse violet, spores of light and an orchid with a lime leaf.', 'chat_bubble', 'data:,', NULL, 460, NULL, NULL, 's2-set-orkide-sisi', 'epic', 23002, 'orkide-sisi', '{"name":{"tr":"Yaprak Damlası","en":"Leaf Drop","de":"Blatttropfen","es":"Gota de hoja","fr":"Goutte de feuille","pt-BR":"Gota de folha","ru":"Капля на листе"},"description":{"tr":"Sera moru, ışık sporları ve kireç yeşili yapraklı bir orkide.","en":"Glasshouse violet, spores of light and an orchid with a lime leaf.","de":"Gewächshausviolett, Lichtsporen und eine Orchidee mit Blatt.","es":"Violeta de invernadero, esporas de luz y una orquídea.","fr":"Violet de serre, spores de lumière et une orchidée.","pt-BR":"Violeta de estufa, esporos de luz e uma orquídea.","ru":"Оранжерейный фиолет, споры света и орхидея с листом."}}'::jsonb, '["shop2","c2","animated","set","set:orkide-sisi"]'::jsonb, NULL),
