('s2-chat_bubble-koi', 'Koi Pond', 'Ripples on top and two koi circling slowly underneath.', 'chat_bubble', 'data:,', NULL, 1150, NULL, NULL, 's2-koi', 'legendary', 23557, NULL, '{"name":{"tr":"Koi Havuzu","en":"Koi Pond","de":"Koi-Teich","es":"Estanque koi","fr":"Bassin à koïs","pt-BR":"Lago de carpas","ru":"Пруд с карпами кои"},"description":{"tr":"Yüzeyde halkalar, altta yavaşça süzülen iki koi balığı.","en":"Ripples on top and two koi circling slowly underneath.","de":"Ringe auf dem Wasser und zwei Koi, die langsam kreisen.","es":"Ondas arriba y dos koi nadando despacio debajo.","fr":"Des ronds dans l''eau et deux koïs qui tournent lentement.","pt-BR":"Ondas na superfície e dois carpas nadando devagar.","ru":"Круги на воде и два кои, медленно плывущих внизу."}}'::jsonb, '["shop2","c2","water","animated"]'::jsonb, NULL),
